<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat</p>
<p>weekly estimate, to Nov 13 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97</p>
<p>wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and</p>
<p>purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of</p>
<p>tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat	0.0  4,100.0   Dec-Nov	4,860.4  1,681.2</p>
<p> Maize	  6,289.0  6,350.0   Mar-Feb	6,470.5    494.1</p>
<p> Sorghum	  648.5    650.0   Mar-Feb	  634.3     14.3</p>
<p> Soybeans     1,993.6  2,000.0   Apr-Mar	2,071.1    404.5</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 541.1    600.0   Jan-Dec	  579.5     12.9</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655</p>
</text>
